# Monitoring Validation

Choose checks by changed area:

- Compose/env: `docker compose --env-file .env.example config`.
- Grafana dashboards: parse changed JSON files and verify datasource UID/job names.
- YAML configs: parse or run available YAML/config checks.
- Alert rules: verify PromQL uses existing metric/job names; run runtime alert tests only when explicitly requested.
- Bootstrap scripts: static review and shell syntax checks when available; do not execute scripts by default.
- Docs-only: Prettier/Markdown formatting when available and stale-reference search.

Always report skipped checks and why. Do not imply that containers were started or VPS scripts were tested when only static validation was performed.
